</code></pre> <p>The final step is to announce the transactions and wait for their confirmation, as described in the Transfer XEM tutorial.</p> <p>When disabling the multisig, the two multisig transactions are announced sequentially. The code waits for the first transaction to be confirmed before announcing the second one, because the second removal is only valid once the first one has been processed.</p>

